# Storage (Cloudflare R2)

- NEVER upload files through the Next.js/Vercel server
- Client uploads directly to R2 with **presigned PUT** URLs
- Generate URLs server-side with `@aws-sdk/client-s3` + `@aws-sdk/s3-request-presigner` (`lib/storage/r2.ts`, `app/actions/upload-actions.ts`)
- Use optimistic UI for guest photo uploads
- Re-check plan limits with `checkUploadAllowed` before presign and after save
- Details: `docs/architecture/storage.md`
